&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;New page&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div&gt;__NOTOC__&lt;br /&gt;
'''Release date:''' December 1, 2012&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
* This release contains a few minor bug fixes for version 2.10. There are no new features.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
* Texture coordinates for cloth geometries are now generated by default so that the front and back sides of the cloth match.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
* Some problems that could occur when a shader is saved in the Shader Editor have been corrected.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
* Cases in which the text box in a save file picker would not be populated properly when a file name was clicked have been corrected.&lt;/div&gt;</summary>
